@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@lecturerToken = REPLACE_WITH_LECTURER_TOKEN
@hocKyId = 1
@lopHocPhanId = 1

### Lecturer: timetable current term
GET {{baseUrl}}/lecturer/timetable
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Lecturer: timetable by term
GET {{baseUrl}}/lecturer/timetable?hoc_ky_id={{hocKyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Lecturer: timetable by class section
GET {{baseUrl}}/lecturer/timetable?hoc_ky_id={{hocKyId}}&lop_hoc_phan_id={{lopHocPhanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Validation case invalid term id, expect 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/lecturer/timetable?hoc_ky_id=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturerToken}}
Accept: application/json
